// setting.json - adapt Calradia Remembers to a total-overhaul mod (e.g. The Old Realms).
//
// Every field is OPTIONAL. Leave a line commented (with //) or absent to keep the Calradia default,
// so a stock install is unchanged. To customise one, remove the // in front of it and edit its value.
// KEEP EVERYTHING INSIDE THE SINGLE { } BELOW: do not add a second { } block.
// After editing, load your save (or run cr.reload_prompts in the console) to apply it.
//
//   worldName           the world's name in prose          (default "Calradia",  e.g. "the Old World")
//   worldAdjective      the world's adjective               (default "Calradian", e.g. "Old-World")
//   patriarchalCultures faction/culture name fragments whose men are skeptical of female authority,
//                       matched case-insensitively against the NPC's faction name
//                       (default ["Vlandia", "Northern Empire", "Western Empire", "Aserai"])
//
